 },
 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "GTA 6 is finally out.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "F3",
       "t": 0.2,
       "crop": [
        140,
        40,
        440,
        248
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Thirteen years after GTA 5, two delays later, after trailers that broke YouTube records, my whole feed is people calling it the best game ever made.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c4",
       "t": 0.3,
       "label": "split"
      },
      {
       "src": "A",
       "t": 28.8,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "B",
       "t": 13.6,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "So here's the opinion that's going to get me roasted in the comments.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c5",
       "t": 12.01,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 is the better game.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "UNPOPULAR OPINION",
       "title": "GTA 5 > GTA 6",
       "bg": "c5",
       "t": 16.1,
       "boom": 0.05
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 6 is the better looking game, I'm not arguing with that.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c3",
       "t": 3.5,
       "label": "split"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "But looking better and being better are two different things, and in this video I'll show you exactly where they split.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c2",
       "t": 9.5,
       "label": "split"
      },
      {
       "src": "c3",
       "t": 8.5,
       "label": "split"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Quick ground rules before the comments explode.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 58.85,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "I'm not saying GTA 6 is bad. Honestly, it's probably a masterpiece.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "F4",
       "t": 136.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "I'm saying that if you asked me which one I'd rather play for the next thousand hours, my answer might surprise you.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 57.3,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Let's get the obvious part out of the way first.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c1",
       "t": 0.8,
       "label": "split"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Look at this beach.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "On the left, GTA 5: a handful of people, a couple of umbrellas, and a lot of empty sand.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c2",
       "t": 2.0,
       "label": "GTA 5",
       "crop": [
        0,
        180,
        640,
        360
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "On the right, GTA 6: crowds, towels, kites, people actually doing things.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c2",
       "t": 2.0,
       "label": "GTA 6",
       "crop": [
        640,
        180,
        640,
        360
       ],
       "repeat": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Same idea, thirteen years apart, and honestly, the difference is ridiculous.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c2",
       "t": 15.0,
       "label": "split"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The water is on another level too.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 0.2,
       "label": "split"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Drive into the harbor in GTA 6, and the car floats for a moment, with waves rolling off it, before it sinks into the murky water.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 18.5,
       "label": "GTA 6",
       "w": 2
      },
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 27.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Go diving, and the water is so clear it barely looks like a game.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 46.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And yes, there are sharks.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 70.27,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Same story with damage.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c3",
       "t": 0.3,
       "label": "split"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Hit a wall in a GTA 5 taxi and you get a little dent.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c8",
       "t": 3.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Do it in GTA 6 and the whole front end folds up.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c8",
       "t": 27.6,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "c8",
       "t": 37.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In GTA 6 every bullet leaves its own hole, the glass cracks right where you hit it, and the metal dents where it should.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c4",
       "t": 21.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "c4",
       "t": 24.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "If you care about detail, GTA 6 wins basically every side by side comparison, and it isn't close.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "pair": [
        [
         "c10",
         27.0
        ],
        [
         "c10",
         40.5
        ]
       ]
      },
      {
       "pair": [
        [
         "c9",
         50.0
        ],
        [
         "c10",
         9.0
        ]
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "But I never played GTA 5 for the sand.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c2",
       "t": 20.5,
       "label": "GTA 5",
       "crop": [
        0,
        180,
        640,
        360
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason number one: realism quietly killed the chaos.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "REASON #1",
       "title": "REALISM KILLED|THE CHAOS",
       "bg": "c5",
       "t": 22
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Watch this.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c5",
       "t": 6.92,
       "label": "GTA 5",
       "repeat": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5. Franklin unloads into a parked car, and a few seconds later it catches fire and goes up in a massive fireball.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Completely unrealistic. Absolutely glorious.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c5",
       "t": 16.0,
       "label": "GTA 5",
       "speed": 0.4,
       "boom": 0.5,
       "repeat": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Now GTA 6.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c5",
       "t": 21.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Same experiment: a full magazine into an SUV on the beach.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "It takes the hits, it smokes, it looks real.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "And then you're just standing there, waiting for something to happen.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA was never a simulator.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c4",
       "t": 8.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "It was a cartoon of America with a rocket launcher.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "The magic of GTA 5 was cause and effect at maximum volume: you do something stupid, and the game answers with something even more stupid.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 6.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Cars flip, cops pile up, and everything explodes.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c8",
       "t": 43.4,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Think about what you actually remember from GTA 5.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 33.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "It's usually not a mission, it's an accident.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "A getaway that turned into a pileup, a cop car flying off a ramp, a rampage that started because somebody bumped into you.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 39.5,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      },
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 0.26,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Nobody remembers how realistic a puddle looked.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 42.2,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The more realistic a game gets, the more it pushes back on that.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 5.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Realistic damage means fewer fireballs.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c5",
       "t": 33.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Smarter police means shorter rampages.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "A",
       "t": 0.2,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And characters that feel like real people make it a lot harder to run them over for fun.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 2.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "All of that is amazing for a story.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "F3",
       "t": 7.2,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "It's worse for the thing most of us actually did in GTA 5 for years, which was mess around.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 51.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason number two: GTA 5 had Trevor.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "REASON #2",
       "title": "GTA 5|HAD TREVOR",
       "bg": "c2",
       "t": 3
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Okay, not only Trevor.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 56.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 gave you three protagonists you could switch between at almost any moment.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "3 PROTAGONISTS",
       "title": "MICHAEL|FRANKLIN|TREVOR",
       "bg": "c4",
       "t": 9
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Michael, the retired bank robber in the middle of a midlife crisis.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "MICHAEL",
       "title": "RETIRED|BANK ROBBER",
       "bg": "c5",
       "t": 2
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Franklin, the kid trying to get out of the hood.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 58.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And Trevor, who is just... Trevor.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "TREVOR",
       "title": "JUST|TREVOR",
       "bg": "c5",
       "t": 16.6
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Switching between them was one of the best ideas Rockstar ever had.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 2.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      },
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 30.5,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "You'd jump to Trevor and find him waking up on a beach in his underwear, or in the middle of a fight nobody explained.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 38.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And then GTA Online let you build your own character on top of all that, and a lot of people lived in that city for more than a decade.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c8",
       "t": 10.5,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 6 goes with two leads, Lucia and Jason, a couple on the run.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "F3",
       "t": 9.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "That's a great setup for a story, a modern Bonnie and Clyde, and judging by the opening scene, the writing is sharp.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "F3",
       "t": 37.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "F3",
       "t": 41.3,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "But three completely different lives crashing into each other is a bigger toy box than one relationship, no matter how good that relationship is.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 12.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "A",
       "t": 18.9,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason number three, and this one is just math.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "REASON #3",
       "title": "13 YEARS|OF CONTENT",
       "bg": "c4",
       "t": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 6 launched with whatever Rockstar managed to finish for day one.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "A",
       "t": 3.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 has had thirteen years.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "SEPT 2013 TO NOV 2026",
       "title": "13 YEARS",
       "bg": "c5",
       "t": 4
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Thirteen years of GTA Online updates.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c5",
       "t": 0.5,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Heists, businesses, hundreds of cars, whole new places like Cayo Perico.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 34.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      },
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 1.0,
       "label": "GTA 5",
       "crop": [
        0,
        180,
        640,
        360
       ],
       "repeat": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 even gave players Director Mode and the Rockstar Editor, basically a free movie studio.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 16.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Some of the GTA 5 footage in this very video was recorded in Director Mode.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c8",
       "t": 7.2,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      },
      {
       "src": "c8",
       "t": 7.2,
       "label": "GTA 5",
       "crop": [
        860,
        0,
        416,
        234
       ],
       "repeat": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And then there's everything Rockstar didn't make: the mods, and the roleplay servers that turned GTA 5 into a completely different game for millions of people and kept it near the top of Twitch years after release.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 45.1,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      },
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 50.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      },
      {
       "src": "c5",
       "t": 4.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Rockstar liked that so much, they bought the team behind FiveM in 2023.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "2023",
       "title": "ROCKSTAR BUYS|THE FIVEM TEAM",
       "bg": "c2",
       "t": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And GTA 6 is console only for now, so the modding scene that kept GTA 5 alive hasn't even started.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "B",
       "t": 0.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And all of it still runs on PCs that are close to ten years old.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c4",
       "t": 15.95,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Day one GTA 6 has to compete with all of that at once.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 45.05,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "That's not really GTA 6's fault.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "A",
       "t": 12.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "But nobody picks a game on a fairness scale. If I have one free weekend, I'm going with the game that has more stuff to do.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 29.5,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Honestly, any launch game would look small next to thirteen years of everything.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 8.5,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason number four might age badly itself, but here it is: realism has an expiration date.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "REASON #4",
       "title": "REALISM HAS AN|EXPIRATION DATE",
       "bg": "c3",
       "t": 8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Every console generation, some game gets crowned the most realistic thing ever made, and a few years later that same footage looks normal, and then it looks old.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 50.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 4.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Graphics are a moving target.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c2",
       "t": 22.16,
       "label": "split"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Whatever blows your mind today is the minimum next generation.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "F4",
       "t": 118.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "What doesn't age is how a game feels.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c10",
       "t": 56.5,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5's driving, its chaos, its jokes about Los Angeles.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 5.8,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      },
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 41.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "People still boot it up in 2026 and have a great time.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 23.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "That's the real test, and GTA 6 can't take it yet, because nobody knows how it'll feel once the shine wears off.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "F4",
       "t": 128.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "B",
       "t": 24.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 has already passed it, every single year since 2013.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c1",
       "t": 0.24,
       "label": "split"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason number five is bigger than GTA: games stop being relevant a lot faster than they used to.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "REASON #5",
       "title": "THE HYPE|BURNS FASTER",
       "bg": "A",
       "t": 30
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 grew up in a world where one game could stay the main topic for years.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c5",
       "t": 9.0,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Think about how many huge games we all played for a month and then completely forgot.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "A",
       "t": 24.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "On launch day they were everywhere, and two weeks later the conversation had moved on.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "B",
       "t": 27.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 is one of the very few games that dodged that, and it did it before TikTok even existed.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 7.8,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 6 launches into a feed that moves on every week.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "grid": [
        [
         "c7",
         20.0
        ],
        [
         "c8",
         30.0
        ],
        [
         "c9",
         21.0
        ],
        [
         "c10",
         8.0
        ],
        [
         "c11",
         50.0
        ],
        [
         "A",
         0.5
        ],
        [
         "B",
         14.0
        ],
        [
         "F3",
         5.0
        ],
        [
         "c11",
         66.0
        ]
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Today it's the only thing anyone is posting.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "In a month, people will have seen every big moment in clips without ever playing it, and the algorithm will be pushing the next thing.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "A",
       "t": 33.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "B",
       "t": 15.5,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The hype for GTA 6 is arguably the biggest any game has ever had.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "F3",
       "t": 0.2,
       "crop": [
        140,
        40,
        440,
        248
       ],
       "repeat": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "But hype that big burns fast, and the higher it goes, the harder it is to live up to.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "B",
       "t": 44.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 never had to compete with thirteen years of people imagining it.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 31.3,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "To be fair, let me argue against myself for a second.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "TO BE FAIR",
       "title": "LET ME ARGUE|AGAINST MYSELF",
       "bg": "B",
       "t": 5
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 6 is on day one.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "A",
       "t": 9.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "GTA 5 on day one didn't have online heists either.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c9",
       "t": 35.6,
       "label": "GTA 5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Those came a year and a half later.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Rockstar will support this game for a decade, and if GTA Online taught us anything, the GTA 6 we're playing in 2030 will be way bigger than what's out today.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c11",
       "t": 55.05,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      },
      {
       "src": "F4",
       "t": 134.0,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "It can also still get really stupid.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 19.9,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Here's a police chase that ends with the GPS saying turn left, straight into the jungle.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "B",
       "t": 32.6,
       "label": "GTA 6",
       "crop": [
        0,
        450,
        480,
        270
       ]
      },
      {
       "src": "B",
       "t": 34.0,
       "label": "GTA 6",
       "w": 2
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "So the chaos isn't gone, it just takes a bit more effort.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 24.6,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And Red Dead Redemption 2 already proved Rockstar's realism can age well.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "RED DEAD REDEMPTION 2",
       "title": "OUT SINCE|2018",
       "bg": "F4",
       "t": 136
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "It came out in 2018 and it still looks better than most games released this year.",
     "shots": []
    },
    {
     "text": "So maybe in five years this video ages like milk.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "c7",
       "t": 44.7,
       "label": "GTA 6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "I'm okay with that.",
     "shots": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "But today, if you ask me which game I'd rather lose a whole weekend in, it's still GTA 5.",
